      "result_description": "Newquay CC - 2nd XI - Won",
      "result_applied_to": "26952",
      "match_notes": "Newquay won the toss and elected to field first, putting a young Roche side into bat. Early wickets meant Roche were 4-4 before recovering slightly and finishing on 106 a/o, D Jeffery with 38 and A LeMasurier with 36, T Venter 6-20 and L Penrose 2-18 doing the damage with the ball. In reply Newquay lost a cluster of wickets to leave themselves with work to do at 50-5, Roche fighting back to leave Newquay 103-9 before a late dropped catch meant Newquay won the game by 1 wicket, T Rodda with 20 for the hosts, P Trethewey 4-21, D Jeffery 3-20 and A LeMasurier 2-27 for the visitors.",
